# LIFE-950: once a day at 3:45 AM Central, after the 3:30 AM backup. Persistent, so a night the host was off runs at the next start. A renewal timer only.
[Unit]
Description=LIFE OS Honcho memory token renewal, 3:45 AM Central

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-* 03:45:00 America/Chicago
Persistent=true
RandomizedDelaySec=0

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
